            "text": "<p></p><h3><strong>💔 Why We Left Etsy (Mostly)</strong></h3><p></p><p><br/></p><p>We blew up fast — too fast for Etsy to believe it was real.<br/>After <em>tons of 5-star reviews</em>, <strong>surging sales</strong>, and a loyal community that showed up hard, Etsy decided something had to be wrong. Their response?<br/>👉 <strong>Locking our funds for 180 days.</strong>We were punished for doing well — not for doing wrong. And there was <em>nothing</em> wrong.<br/>So we built this.<br/><strong>The Vault lives here now.</strong> The rarest, weirdest, wildest pieces are sold exclusively on our site — no fees, no limits, no censorship.<br/>If you’ve loved what we do, <strong>support us directly</strong>. Etsy will stay up for now, but only this site gets the real heat.<br/>🙏 Thank you for believing in our work. Let’s keep it weird — our way.<br/><br/><br/></p>"
